  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, bring the beef stock to a boil over medium‑high heat.",
    "Add the sliced lemongrass, galangal, and kaffir lime leaves, and simmer for 10 minutes to infuse aromatics.",
    "Reduce heat to low and add the thinly sliced beef, cooking until the meat is just cooked through, about 3‑4 minutes.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic, ginger, and sliced shallot, and let the flavors marry for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, black pepper, and red chili flakes, and simmer gently for another 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning, adding more lime juice or fish sauce if needed.",
    "Ladle the soup into bowls, garnish with fresh cilantro if desired, and serve hot."
  ],
